          "distinguish-big-data"
        ],
        "method": "完成情境判断并说明依据。",
        "successCriteria": [
          "能准确列出至少3个V的特征",
          "能指出传统方案在对应情境下的局限"
        ]
      }
    },
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-chapter-intro",
        "moduleId": "mod-intro",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "大数据管理的背景",
        "markdown": "随着互联网、物联网和移动通信的快速发展，数据产生的速度和规模远超传统数据库系统的处理能力。大数据管理作为数据库技术的前沿方向，致力于应对海量、多样、高速变化的数据存储、处理与分析需求。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000751"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "大数据管理"
              ],
              "lineStart": 12161,
              "lineEnd": 12168,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "febb2c36ce87cdc93b23994038d7f5151061de66f7e897989e2548a9be66c401"
            },
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000752"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "大数据管理",
                "大数据概述"
              ],
              "lineStart": 12169,
              "lineEnd": 12170,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "996e87a44908a831434a6a48feff415633e33899d07bd70456b826bacccdcf3e"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-concept-anchor",
        "moduleId": "mod-intro",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "生活中的大数据场景",
        "markdown": "可以把大数据想象成一座不断喷发的信息火山：社交媒体每秒产生数百万条消息，传感器网络持续上报温度与位置，电商平台实时记录点击与交易。这些数据的共同特点不仅是量大，更在于来源复杂、变化极快，且蕴含巨大但稀疏的价值。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-chapter-intro"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-what-is-big-data",
        "moduleId": "mod-intro",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "什么是大数据",
        "markdown": "大数据是指无法在可容忍时间内用传统数据库工具进行采集、管理和处理的数据集合。它不仅指数据规模超出常规，更强调数据类型复杂、产生速度快，以及从中提取价值的难度。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000753"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "大数据管理",
                "什么是大数据"
              ],
              "lineStart": 12171,
              "lineEnd": 12192,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "1905f13a475d97598da45d76bad63e8238dffe5327ef11eae96df0cd12e79f37"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-features-overview",
        "moduleId": "mod-characteristics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "大数据的特征总述",
        "markdown": "业界通常用多个V来描述大数据的核心特征，包括数据规模（Volume）、数据类型（Variety）、处理速度（Velocity）、价值密度（Value）和数据质量（Veracity）。这些维度共同决定了大数据管理的技术挑战。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000754"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "大数据管理",
                "大数据的特征"
              ],
              "lineStart": 12193,
              "lineEnd": 12196,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "d930db1cb8cb100a16af2d0013addc0ee2adf73a07d979164330a6a163e5db67"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-exercise",
        "moduleId": "mod-check",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "情境判断",
        "markdown": "某电商平台每日产生数亿条用户行为日志，包括点击、浏览、购买记录以及商品图片和评论文本。请判断该场景是否属于大数据管理范畴，并说明涉及哪些V特征。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-what-is-big-data",
            "tb-features-overview"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-volume",
        "moduleId": "mod-characteristics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "巨量（Volume）",
        "markdown": "数据规模达到TB、PB甚至EB级别，远超传统数据库单机的存储和处理上限。海量数据要求分布式存储和并行计算架构，以保证可扩展性。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000755"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "大数据管理",
                "巨量"
              ],
              "lineStart": 12197,
              "lineEnd": 12218,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "34d554f13cee0ab6806c6418dba243f074fda32abde8a8bc5e3f37421f857fa0"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-variety",
        "moduleId": "mod-characteristics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "多样（Variety）",
        "markdown": "数据类型包括结构化、半结构化和非结构化数据，如文本、图像、音频、视频、日志和传感器流。多样性要求系统能够灵活处理不同格式的数据，而不是强制所有数据适应统一的表结构。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000756"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "大数据管理",
                "多样"
              ],
              "lineStart": 12219,
              "lineEnd": 12226,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "b9cb2552052fb65748e5ffb037a5d8b33f2e49da3dda7f8d54586a5edf4f9e79"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-velocity",
        "moduleId": "mod-characteristics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "快变（Velocity）",
        "markdown": "数据产生和处理的速度极快，往往要求实时或近实时响应。流式数据的持续到达对系统的吞吐量和延迟提出了更高要求。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000757"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "大数据管理",
                "快变"
              ],
              "lineStart": 12227,
              "lineEnd": 12232,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "f7ec7a8aee8c0b7af442a5df7892c9bbba4784501d65e0fd4b8848963648887e"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-value",
        "moduleId": "mod-characteristics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "价值（Value）与真实性（Veracity）",
        "markdown": "大数据的价值密度通常较低，需要通过分析和挖掘才能提取出有用信息。同时，数据来源广泛、质量参差不齐，真实性和可信度成为不可忽视的问题。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
